<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Link Your LeetCode Account - LeetCode Tracker</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    
    .container {
      background: white;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 40px;
      max-width: 600px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    
    .header {
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    
    .header h1 {
      color: #2d3748;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      font-size: 2.5em;
    }
    
    .header p {
      color: #718096;
      font-size: 1.2em;
      margin: 0;
    }
    
    .steps {
      background: #f7fafc;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      text-align: left;
    }
    
    .steps h2 {
      color: #2d3748;
      margin: 0 0 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    
    .step {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
    }
    
    .step-number {
      background: #667eea;
      color: white;
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-weight: bold;
      margin-right: 15px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    
    .step-content h3 {
      margin: 0 0 8px 0;
      color: #2d3748;
    }
    
    .step-content p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #718096;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
    
    .actions {
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
    
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      margin: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    .btn-primary {
      background: #667eea;
      color: white;
    }
    
    .btn-primary:hover {
      background: #5a67d8;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    
    .btn-secondary {
      background: #e2e8f0;
      color: #4a5568;
    }
    
    .btn-secondary:hover {
      background: #cbd5e0;
    }
    
    .extension-note {
      background: #e6fffa;
      border: 1px solid #81e6d9;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    
    .extension-note h3 {
      color: #2c7a7b;
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
    }
    
    .extension-note p {
      color: #285e61;
      margin: 0;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>🔗 Link Your LeetCode Account</h1>
      <p>Welcome, <%= current_user.email %>! To access your dashboard, you need to link your LeetCode account first.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="steps">
      <h2>📋 Follow These Steps:</h2>
      
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Go to LeetCode</h3>
          <p>Visit <a href="https://leetcode.com" target="_blank" style="color: #667eea;">leetcode.com</a> and make sure you're logged in to your LeetCode account.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Install Our Chrome Extension</h3>
          <p>If you haven't already, install our LeetCode Tracker Chrome extension from the Chrome Web Store.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Click "Link Account"</h3>
          <p>While on LeetCode, click the extension icon and then click "Link Account" to connect your account.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="step">
        <div class="step-number">4</div>
        <div class="step-content">
          <h3>Access Your Dashboard</h3>
          <p>You'll be automatically redirected to your dashboard where you can see your LeetCode progress!</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="extension-note">
      <h3>💡 Chrome Extension Required</h3>
      <p>Our Chrome extension securely connects your LeetCode account to our app. It only reads your LeetCode data and doesn't store any passwords or sensitive information.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="actions">
      <a href="https://leetcode.com" target="_blank" class="btn btn-primary">🚀 Go to LeetCode</a>
      <a href="/" class="btn btn-secondary">🏠 Back to Home</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

